                          "text": "If the goblin scribe thinks Horacio's title is duke:",
                          "steps": [
                            {
                              "npc": "Ur-tag, head of the Council, signed a peace treaty with Duke Horacio of Lumbridge, ruler of the town above the Dorgeshuuns' mine."
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "condition",
                              "text": "If the goblin scribe thinks the monster hate group is H.A.M.:",
                              "steps": [
                                {
                                  "npc": "But not all surface-dwellers were friendly, and a faction called H.A.M. attempted to destroy the Dorgeshuun."
